              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جھاڑو لگانا (jhāṛū lagānā) is \"to apply the broom\". jhāṛū is built on jhāṛnā, \"to sweep\", which CDIAL lists under jhāṭayati, \"shakes down\" (CDIAL 5328); lagānā is the causing form of lagnā, \"to be attached\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit lagyati (CDIAL 10895)."
